        <h1>Designer, copywriter, and artist based in Kent.</h1>
        <p>You could <a href="/studio/">hire me</a> to make things look good, which is sensible, because first impressions are good for business. But what I’m most proud of is absorbing as much as I can about your world, and working closely with you through big changes.</p>
        <p>My bread and butter are websites (UX/UI), copywriting, brand messaging, and graphic design. In other words: if people don't get what you do, I rewrite it; if they can't work out how to buy, I redesign it; and if they can't tell you from the place down the road, I find what makes you different and say it loud.</p>
        <p>I'm currently open to freelance and permanent work.</p>
